<title>JAPAN: Japan 97/98 govt debt via public sector Y15.1 trln.</title>
<headline>Japan 97/98 govt debt via public sector Y15.1 trln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's public sector will underwrite 15.1368 trillion yen worth of government debt in fiscal 1997/98, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A breakdown of the figures, in trillions of yen, is as follows (all figures preliminary and rounded):</p>
<p>				     1997/98	 1996/97</p>
<p> Public sector		   15.1368	 14.8816</p>
<p>    Trust Fund Bureau	   9.7052	  8.6000</p>
<p>    Postal savings		3.4000	  3.2500</p>
<p>Roll-over of maturing</p>
<p>    bonds held by the BOJ     2.0316	  3.0316</p>
<p>--Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
